[4.107171, "o", "suggest one small additional\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[6;49H│ assertion.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[7;49H╰─ read-only source analysis\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[8;49H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\n• Read src/railmux/fast_display_client.py\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[10;49H• Read tests/test_fast_full_window.py\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[11;49H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;118m\nTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[13;49Hrailmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b[K\u001b[14;49H1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[K\u001b[15;49H2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and retur\u001b[16;49Hns HistoryAction with render_history=True\u001b[K\u001b[17;49Hand forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[K\u001b[18;49H3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux\u001b[19;49H. The overlay is painted client-side via\u001b[K\u001b[20;49Hsurface.paint_overlays.\u001b[K\u001b[21;49H4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes st\u001b[22;49Hock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode,\u001b[K\u001b[23;49Hwhich is deliberately avoided.\u001b[K\u001b[24;49HFocused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel\u001b[25;49H asserts agent_action.forwarded_input ==\u001b[K\u001b[26;49Hb\"\".\u001b[K\u001b[27;49HSuggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather than merely \u001b[28;49Hdropping the event.\u001b[K\u001b[29;49H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;70m\n✓ Read-only analysis complete · transcript 58f46732e1c4\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[31;49H› Captured once; sanitized transcript replay; no provider session persisted.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[32;49H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n Railmux · Claude Code · ▣                                                                                                             \u001b[38;5;231m→ new session in railmux\u001b[30m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[32;49H"]
